- createIslandGroup()
- createBirds()
And they return objects with update(t, dt).

Now the camera rig. Shots as described. Let me write cameraRig.js:

```js
const SHOTS = [
  { name: 'wide', dur: 21, pos: [-24, 8.5, -28], look: [-0.6, 2.1, 3.0], fov: 41, drift: 0.55 },
  { name: 'track', dur: 18, pos: [-8.5, 2.6, -9.5], look: [0.4, 1.8, 0.4], fov: 48, drift: 0.4 },
  { name: 'sun', dur: 17, pos: [-13, 3.4, -13.5], look: [0.2, 2.0, 3.5], fov: 52, drift: 0.3 },
